{
  "$comment": "编辑用分块，由 build.py 拼进 request.schema.json。",
  "$defs": {
    "format": {
      "enum": [
        "xlsx",
        "xlsm",
        "docx",
        "pptx"
      ]
    },
    "inspectRequest": {
      "description": "按 scope 看文件的一部分。",
      "descriptionEn": "View part of the file according to scope.",
      "limits": "不要一次要整份文件。不带 scope 只返回名单，不返回单元格。xlsx 公式格的 value 是包里的缓存，没有缓存则为 null，库不算。改内容用 apply，不要把这次看到的树整份送回去当修改。",
      "limitsEn": "Do not request the whole file at once. Without scope the result is only the list, not cells. An xlsx formula cell's value is the cached value in the package; it is null when there is no cache, and the library does not calculate it. To change content, use apply. Do not send the whole tree you just saw back as the edit.",
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "inspect"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "scope": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/inspectScope"
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "inspectScope": {
      "description": "查看范围。",
      "descriptionEn": "Scope to view.",
      "limits": "三种格式的键不能混用。xlsx 看格子要同时给 sheet 和 range。没列出的键不要写。",
      "limitsEn": "Do not mix keys from the three formats. To view xlsx cells, give both sheet and range. Do not write keys that are not listed.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "sheet": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "range": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "maxCells": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 20000,
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "from": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "maxParas": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 5000,
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "headerFooter": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "pictures": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "textBoxes": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "shapes": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "textBoxContent": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "comments": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "charts": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "smartArt": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "slicers": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "protectedRanges": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "connections": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "externalLinks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "customViews": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "cellStyles": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "oleObjects": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "formControls": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "legacyPictures": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "watermarks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "tables": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "connectors": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "inkCanvases": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "model3ds": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "inks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "timing": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "masters": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "notesMaster": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "handout": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "media": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "sections": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "customShows": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "zooms": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "revisions": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "hyperlinks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "sparklines": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx"
          ]
        },
        "bookmarks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "editRanges": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "fields": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "tocs": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "captions": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "crossRefs": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "indexes": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "indexEntries": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "sources": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "citations": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "bibliographies": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "docParts": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "embeddedFonts": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "maths": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "xlsx",
            "docx",
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "contentControls": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "numbering": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "styles": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "runs": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "rubies": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "formats": [
            "docx"
          ]
        },
        "slide": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        },
        "maxShapes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 5000,
          "formats": [
            "pptx"
          ]
        }
      },
      "dependentRequired": {
        "range": [
          "sheet"
        ],
        "sheet": [
          "range"
        ],
        "from": [
          "maxParas"
        ],
        "maxParas": [
          "from"
        ],
        "maxShapes": [
          "slide"
        ],
        "textBoxContent": [
          "textBoxes"
        ]
      }
    },
    "createRequest": {
      "description": "整包生成一份新文件。目标路径已存在则覆盖。",
      "descriptionEn": "Generate a whole new file. An existing path is overwritten.",
      "limits": "改已有内容用 apply，不要靠 create 覆盖。xlsx 用 workbook，docx 用 document，pptx 用 presentation，三者不要同时写。",
      "limitsEn": "To change existing content, use apply instead of overwriting with create. xlsx uses workbook, docx uses document, and pptx uses presentation. Do not write all three together.",
      "type": "object",
      "comment": "path 必填。xlsx 用 workbook，docx 用 document，pptx 用 presentation，三者不能同时出现。",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "create"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "workbook": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/xlsxWorkbook"
        },
        "document": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/docxDocument"
        },
        "presentation": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/pptxPresentation"
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "required": [
            "workbook"
          ]
        },
        {
          "required": [
            "document"
          ]
        },
        {
          "required": [
            "presentation"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "exportMediaRequest": {
      "description": "按 id 把图或嵌入对象的原始字节写到本地。",
      "descriptionEn": "Write the original bytes of a picture or an embedded object to a local file, by id.",
      "limits": "不改源文件，字节也不进 inspect 树。",
      "limitsEn": "Does not modify the source file, and the bytes are not placed in the inspect tree.",
      "type": "object",
      "comment": "output 必填。不得默认写成源 path。",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path",
        "id"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "exportMedia"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "output": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "applyRequest": {
      "description": "用 id 和 op 改文件里点名的内容。",
      "descriptionEn": "Use id and op to change the named content in the file.",
      "limits": "不要把整棵 inspect 树塞进请求。",
      "limitsEn": "Do not send the whole inspect tree back as the edit.",
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path",
        "ops"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "apply"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "output": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "dryRun": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ops": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/anyApplyOp"
          }
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "format": {
                "enum": [
                  "xlsx",
                  "xlsm"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "format"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "ops": {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/xlsxApplyOp"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "format": {
                "const": "docx"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "format"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "ops": {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/docxApplyOp"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "format": {
                "const": "pptx"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "format"
            ]
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "ops": {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/pptxApplyOp"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "exportChartDataRequest": {
      "description": "把图表背后的工作簿数据导出。",
      "descriptionEn": "Export the workbook data behind a chart.",
      "limits": "不改源文件，不算公式。",
      "limitsEn": "Does not modify the source file and does not evaluate formulas.",
      "type": "object",
      "comment": "output 必填。不得默认写成源 path。",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path",
        "id"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "exportChartData"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "output": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "exportChartImageRequest": {
      "description": "把 xlsx 簇状柱形图画成 PNG。",
      "descriptionEn": "Draw an xlsx clustered column chart to a PNG.",
      "limits": "只读。不改源包，像素不进 inspect。只画簇状柱形图，系列用包里已有的缓存。docx 与 pptx 报 InvalidField。其余图报 NotImplemented。宽或高超出 1 到 4096 像素也报 NotImplemented。",
      "limitsEn": "Read only. Does not modify the source package, and pixels do not enter inspect. Only clustered column charts are drawn, using caches already in the package. docx and pptx return InvalidField. Other charts return NotImplemented. Width or height outside 1 to 4096 pixels also returns NotImplemented.",
      "type": "object",
      "comment": "output 必填。不得默认写成源 path。contentType 固定为 image/png。",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path",
        "id",
        "output"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "exportChartImage"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "output": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "exportPageImageRequest": {
      "description": "把 docx 里没有字的一页画成 PNG。",
      "descriptionEn": "Draw one docx page that has no text to a PNG.",
      "limits": "只读。不改源包，像素不进 inspect。id 是 page:N，从 1 起。只画单节、空段、Calibri 11 磅、没有页眉页脚的白页。宽高按 w:pgSz，96 dpi，twip×96/1440 四舍五入，要落在 1 到 4096 像素。有字、表格、图、页眉页脚或别的行距报 NotImplemented。xlsx 与 pptx 报 InvalidField。",
      "limitsEn": "Read only. Does not modify the source package, and pixels do not enter inspect. id is page:N, starting at 1. Only a white page with one section, empty paragraphs, Calibri 11 pt, and no header or footer is drawn. Width and height come from w:pgSz at 96 dpi, rounding twip times 96/1440, and must be 1 to 4096 pixels. Text, tables, pictures, headers, footers, or another line spacing return NotImplemented. xlsx and pptx return InvalidField.",
      "type": "object",
      "comment": "output 必填。不得默认写成源 path。contentType 固定为 image/png。",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path",
        "id",
        "output"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "exportPageImage"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "output": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "exportSlideImageRequest": {
      "description": "把 pptx 一页的纯色页底、PNG 和没有描边的实心矩形画成 PNG。",
      "descriptionEn": "Draw a pptx slide's solid background, PNG pictures, and solid rectangles without a stroke to a PNG.",
      "limits": "只读。不改源包，像素不进 inspect。只画幻灯片自己的不透明纯色页底、没有旋转翻转裁剪的 PNG，以及没有翻转、没有描边的不透明实心矩形，含绕中心转 90 度倍数。后画的盖住先画的，超出页面的部分裁掉。半透明、文字、其它形状和图表不画。组合里的图、视频和音频报 NotImplemented。宽或高超出 1 到 4096 像素也报 NotImplemented。xlsx 与 docx 报 InvalidField。",
      "limitsEn": "Read only. Does not modify the source package, and pixels do not enter inspect. Only the slide's own opaque solid background, unrotated unflipped uncropped PNG pictures, and opaque solid rectangles without a flip or a stroke are drawn, including quarter turns around the center. Later objects cover earlier ones, and the part outside the page is clipped. Translucent fills, text, other shapes, and charts are not drawn. Pictures inside groups, video, and audio return NotImplemented. Width or height outside 1 to 4096 pixels also returns NotImplemented. xlsx and docx return InvalidField.",
      "type": "object",
      "comment": "output 必填。不得默认写成源 path。contentType 固定为 image/png。",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path",
        "id",
        "output"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "exportSlideImage"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "output": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "layoutCheckRequest": {
      "description": "只读检查页上形状的几何，不改文件。",
      "descriptionEn": "Check shape geometry on slides without changing the file.",
      "limits": "不生成图片，不调用 Office，不重排。本期只做 pptx，其余格式报 InvalidField。",
      "limitsEn": "No images, no Office calls, no reflow. Only pptx is supported in this phase; other formats return InvalidField.",
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "action",
        "path"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "schemaVersion": {
          "const": 1
        },
        "action": {
          "const": "layoutCheck"
        },
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "format": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/format"
        },
        "locale": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "helpRequest": {
      "description": "查某个操作怎么填。",
      "descriptionEn": "Look up how to fill in an operation.",
      "limits": "先搜再打开。不要猜字段，也不要把别的格式的字段套过来。本工具不支持预览。xlsx 的簇状柱形图可以按 exportChartImage 写成 PNG。pptx 可以按 exportSlideImage 把纯色页底、PNG 和没有描边的实心矩形写成图，文字和其它形状还不画。docx 没有字的页可以按 exportPageImage 写成 PNG，有字的页还不画。像素不进 inspect。机器上有 Microsoft Office 或 WPS 时，可以自己导出后再查看：Word、Excel，以及 WPS 的 kwps、ket，用 ExportAsFixedFormat 写成 PDF；PowerPoint 和 WPS 的 kwpp 用幻灯片的 Export 写成 PNG。本工具不调用它们。",
      "limitsEn": "Search first, then open one operation. Do not guess fields, and do not reuse fields from another format. This tool does not preview a whole page. An xlsx clustered column chart can be written to PNG with exportChartImage. A pptx slide's solid background, PNG pictures, and solid rectangles without a stroke can be written with exportSlideImage. Those pixels do not enter inspect. Text and other shapes are not drawn yet. A docx page with no text can be written to PNG with exportPageImage. Pages with text are not drawn yet. If Microsoft Office or WPS is installed, export and then look: Word, Excel, and WPS kwps and ket use ExportAsFixedFormat to write a PDF; PowerPoint and WPS kwpp use the slide Export method to write a PNG. This tool does not call them.",
